WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.648
The page header contains the home slides: their photographs, headlines,

00:00:05.698 --> 00:00:08.430
supporting text, and optional buttons.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:12.311
Let’s make a small wording change to the first slide.

00:00:12.361 --> 00:00:16.265
Website copy also supports bold and italic formatting;

00:00:16.315 --> 00:00:19.559
the hint above the editor shows the notation.
